'edits_remaining': '5'}, 'is_translatable': False, 'views': {'count': '2592', 'state': 'EnabledWithCount'}, 'source': '<a href="http://twitter.com/download/iphone" rel="nofollow">Twitter for iPhone</a>', 'note_tweet': {'is_expandable': True, 'note_tweet_results': {'result': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4Nzc3ODI1Njk5OTI4MDIzMDQ=', 'text': 'So heartbreaking and devastating. From a screen you will never understand the true pain this is causing for people. California needs its neighbors to show up and help them through this mess. I hope habitat for humanity ( @Habitat_org ) sees a surge of volunteers and resources to help these people rebuild and recoup their homes and mindset after losing everything. I don’t have much money but I would definitely take my kids there to help for the volunteer experience. If anyone knows of any organizations doing something like that, let me know, we’d be coming from Florida to help!\n\nIn the meantime, here are some resources I found I could share.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '33898911', 'name': 'Habitat for Humanity', 'screen_name': 'Habitat_org', 'indices': [221, 233]}]}}}}, 'quoted_status_result': {'result': {'__typename': 'Tweet', 'rest_id': '1877411308695364058', 'core': {'user_results': {'result': {'__typename': 'User', 'id': 'VXNlcjoxNDEzNjQxMjc1', 'rest_id': '1413641275', 'affiliates_highlighted_label': {}, 'has_graduated_access': True, 'is_blue_verified': True, 'profile_image_shape': 'Circle', 'legacy': {'can_dm': True, 'can_media_tag': False, 'created_at': 'Wed May 08 19:16:58 +0000 2013', 'default_profile': True, 'default_profile_image': False, 'description': 'Mom, Space Enthusiast, Music Lover, Artist, Critic & Humorist. Active on X, Miami Global member-🎙️I speak on politics, technology & everyday life-Go SpaceX🚀', 'entities': {'description': {'urls': []}, 'url': {'urls': [{'display_url': 'neuralkink.com', 'expanded_url': 'http://www.neuralkink.com', 'url': 'https://t.co/