IRERELIEF25 - up to 2 $25 rides.\n\n.@Uber_Support is offering evacuees a free ride for a max of $40 using the code WILDFIRE25\n\nThey have set a max of 500 rides so please only use those codes if you need them.\n\n.@Airbnb has also joined in to help with sheltering, they are working with 211 in the LA area to provide resources.\n\nStay safe and never lose hope. I pray for your safety and recovery.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': [{'id_str': '569569550', 'name': 'Lyft', 'screen_name': 'Lyft', 'indices': [467, 472]}, {'id_str': '2815754953', 'name': 'Uber Support', 'screen_name': 'Uber_Support', 'indices': [556, 569]}, {'id_str': '17416571', 'name': 'Airbnb', 'screen_name': 'Airbnb', 'indices': [731, 738]}]}}}}, 'quotedRefResult': {'result': {'__typename': 'Tweet', 'rest_id': '1877316761898594604'}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 1, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Thu Jan 09 17:45:11 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1877411308695364058', 'display_text_range': [0, 278], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'timestamps': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}, 'favorite_count': 7, 'favorited': False, 'full_text': 'If you’re impacted and don’t know where to go or what to do, there is support being offered by some companies and organizations to help.\n\nThere are shelters available for those without housing.\n\nPasadena Civic Auditorium — 300 E. Green St, Pasadena\n\nWestwood Recreation Center —', 'is_quote_status': True, 'lang': 'en', 'quote_count': 2, 'quoted_status_id_str': '1877316761898594604', 'quoted_status_permalink': {'url': 'https://t.co/G7SVL5Vw2e', 'expanded': 'https://twitter.com/ParisHilton/status/1877316761898594604', 'display': 'x.com/ParisHilton/st…'}, 'reply_count': 2, 'retweet_count': 1, 'retweeted': False, 'user_id_str': '1413641275', 'id_str': '1877411308695364058'}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 1, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Fri Jan 10 18:20:26 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '18